# Override any subset of darklab_shell's built-in application settings here.
# Settings you omit keep their shipped values. Other supported local content
# overrides use the same relative names under this deployment's conf/ directory.
#
# Built-in settings, defaults, and examples (reference only):
# https://gitlab.com/darklab.sh/darklab_shell/-/blob/v@RELEASE_VERSION@/app/conf/config.yaml
# Operator guide:
# https://gitlab.com/darklab.sh/darklab_shell/-/blob/v@RELEASE_VERSION@/CONFIGURATION.md
#
# Common optional feature switches for this Compose deployment live in ../.env:
# WORKSPACE_ENABLED, INTERACTIVE_PTY_ENABLED, and RAW_PACKET_SCANNING_ENABLED.
# Use this file for feature fine-tuning and settings without environment overrides.
#
# YAML settings use `key: value`, not `key = value`.
# Example - remove the leading # to use it:
# workspace_max_file_mb: 10
